# Changes to Graey's real parameters that only the simulator needs, applied on
# top of params/graey_4.5.7_autonomous_validated.parm. Keep this list short and
# say WHY for each: everything not here is Graey's actual configuration.

# Graey's real thrusters 3, 4 and 6 have reversed props/wiring and the Cube is
# told so. The simulator's thrusters are all mounted the standard way, so on the
# real values those three push backwards and the sub spins in place.
MOT_3_DIRECTION 1
MOT_4_DIRECTION 1
MOT_6_DIRECTION 1
